# Project Intelligence: minimaxh3

- Read all files in memory-bank/ at session start; techContext.md has the machine-specific gotchas.
- GPU is shared: `vllm.service` (user systemd) normally occupies ~93GB VRAM. Stop it before
  generation, and remember the user's Qwen endpoint on port 8000 goes down when you do.
- Always use `HF_HOME=~/.cache/hf` — the default HF cache is root-owned and sudo is interactive.
- diffusers is pinned to a PR commit; MiniMax-H3 is not in a diffusers release yet.
- FL2VA vs Ref2VA: different transformer partitions (`transformer/` vs `transformer_ref/`).
  Build with `build_pipeline(..., task="ref2va")` / `--ref KIND:PATH`. Do not keep both
  resident — host RAM cannot hold two 62GB transformers plus the conditioner.
- User prefers single quotes for static CLI arguments.
